<section class="about reveal" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-tag">Institutional Impact</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Capability in Action</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      KIPROD programmes are designed around real executive conversations,
      institutional transformation workshops, and applied learning environments
